            <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Defilers stalk into battle on six segmented legs, and have two gigantic claws capable of snatching up and bisecting a Space Marine or shearing through the hull of an armoured vehicle. The Defiler kit has a huge array of options to choose from. With that in mind, we thought it’d be really fun to go through the process of building it and showcase some of those awesome options. Tune in and follow along as Ollie builds this incredible miniature.]]></description>
